      "id": "claim_91e2e65cc08248cd92a23593694bf846",
      "statement": "nextWait maps chunk results to waits: busy or dispossessed wait for the lock to be free or stale, deferred and 429 yields wait until notBefore, a no-answer yield backs off, a refusal (including a cross-file gate failure) waits for an input-file change, other throws wait for an input change at most until the backoff, and a completed chunk with nothing due waits for an input change at most 24 hours.",
      "evidence": [
